{title: Lowest of Slaves}
{subtitle: Genesis 9:18; 10:6; 9:20–25; 9:26–27; 10:15–19; 10:19}
{key: Bb}
{tempo: 70}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Bb] | [Bb] | [Eb] | [Bb] |
| [Eb] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Bb]Shem and Japheth came out of the ark [Eb]
[Bb]Ham the fa[Bb/D]ther of Ca[Eb]naan
[Bb]Noah plant[Bb/D]ed a vine[Eb]yard first
[Cm7]He drank wine and lay un[F]covered
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Bb]Cursed be Ca[Bb/D]naan he says
[Eb]Lowest [F]of slaves to his [Bb]brothers
Blessed be the [Bb/D]God of Shem
[Eb]May [F]Canaan be his [Bb]slave [Bbmaj7][Eb]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Bb]Ham saw his father's na[Eb]kedness
[Bb]Told his two [Bb/D]brothers outside [Eb]
[Bb]Shem and Japheth [Eb]took a garment
[Cm7]Walked in backward to cov[F]er him
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Bb]Cursed be Ca[Bb/D]naan he says
[Eb]Lowest [F]of slaves to his [Bb]brothers
Blessed be [Bb/D]the God of Shem
[Eb]May [F]Canaan be his [Bb]slave [Bbmaj7][Eb]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Bb]Sidon his firstborn and Heth [Eb]
[Bb]Jebusites [Bb/D]and Amorites [Eb]
[Bb]Girgas[Bb/D]hites and Hi[Eb]vites
[Cm7]Clans scattered across the [F]land
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
[Bb]From [Bb/D]Sidon toward [Eb]Gerar
[Bb]As far as [Bb/D]Gaza and [Eb]Lasha
{end_of_verse}

{comment: Outro (instrumental)}
